{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっほーっ(o・・o)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんなんだねっ(o・・o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まっちゅん、今風邪なんか花粉症なんか\nよくわからんねんけど\n喉が痛くってよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"声がでやんでよ〜\nけど元気なんよ〜＼(^^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それで突然やけど\n松村のどうでもええ\n昔の話をおもいだしたから\nちょっと話したい！話す！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えぇ昔々"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは松村が中学生か小学生の高学年くらいの話やねんけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族でご飯食べにいったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べ過ぎて胃が気持ち悪くなっちゃってさ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"粉薬の胃腸薬を母からもらって飲んだんよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不味すぎて吐いた／(^^)＼あちゃー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けど、胃の中のものが全部でて\n気分はよくなったから\n結果オーライって話(￣▽￣)ｂ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、これは結構最近の話やねんけど\nお薬飲めたね♪みたいな\nお薬包み込むゼリーあるやん？\nあれを使って粉薬のんでたんよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んで、半分くらいまでちょびちょび\nゼリーに包んで\nのんでてんけど\n途中でめっちゃめんどくさなって\n「大丈夫やろ〜」って\n残りの粉薬を一気にそのまま飲んだん！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"吐いたよね／(^^)＼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんまに今までの努力が水の泡よ(  ；∀；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんでそれ以来、粉薬が飲めんくなった(  ；∀；)\n今だにアカンの〜(  ；∀；)\n粒の薬はなんぼでも\nいけるんやけど・・・"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こども用の苺味の風邪薬が一番好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん、粉薬のめますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２０歳なんですけど\n苺味の風邪薬で大丈夫ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、今日久しぶりにメロンパン食べたっ(o・・o)\nうんまいっっ(o・・o)ｂ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2013/01/24/5447995/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほなら、おやすみなさゆりんっ(o・・o)/~"}],"source":"archive"}